# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and restart `npx expo start`: Expo reads EXPO_PUBLIC_* at start.
#
# The API (backend/). Unset: Food Database searches only the bundled USDA list, and nothing
# leaves the device.
# Set: Food Database searches the API and falls back to the bundled list when the API can't be
# reached. The app also syncs its entries, saved foods, goals and steps to that server in the
# background (demo entries excluded); with the API unreachable it works as before and sends
# them later.
# On a phone use this Mac's LAN address, and run the API with --host 0.0.0.0 (see backend/README.md).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
